            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.8</h3><ul><li>Mail monitors can skip newsletters and promos: turn on "Skip bulk mail" in Settings &gt; Monitors (agents: exclude_bulk). Senders you add under "Always allow" (agents: bulk_allow) still get through, for services and clients that send list mail you want to see.</li></ul>]]></description>
